gthened or added sectoral target","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248924260,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_pa","indicator_name":"Strengthened or added policies and actions","value":"No previous submission available"},{"id":248924452,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_pa","indicator_name":"Strengthened or added policies and actions","value":"No revision compared with previous version"},{"id":248924605,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_pa","indicator_name":"Strengthened or added policies and actions","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248924826,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_adp","indicator_name":"Strengthened adaptation","value":"No previous submission available"},{"id":248925018,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_adp","indicator_name":"Strengthened adaptation","value":"No revision compared with previous version"},{"id":248925171,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_adp","indicator_name":"Strengthened adaptation","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248925392,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"No previous submission available"},{"id":248925584,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"No revision compared with previous version"},{"id":248925737,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Overall Comparison with Previous NDC","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ndce_ctu","indicator_name":"Provided additional Information for clarity, transparency, and understanding","value":"Yes, enhancement in the revised submission"},{"id":248925957,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"Pakistan is committed to reduce its emissions after reaching peak levels to the extent possible subject to affordability, provision of international climate finance, transfer of technology and capacity building. As such Pakistan will only be able to make specific commitments once reliable data on our peak emission levels is available.\"\u003c/p\u003e"},{"id":248926147,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"Having considered the existing potential for mitigation in the country, Pakistan intends to reduce up to 20% of its 2030 projected GHG emissions subject to availability of international grants to meet the total abatement cost for the indicated 20 percent reduction amounting to about US$ 40 billion at current prices.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePakistan INDC also includes a section on adaptation. "},{"id":248926300,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\"Hence, Pakistan intends to set a cumulative ambitious aim of conditional and voluntary contributions of overall 50% reduction of its projected emissions by 2030, with a 15% drop below business as usual (BAU) from the country’s own resources, and an additional 35% drop below BAU subject to international financial support.\""},{"id":248926432,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"indc_summary","indicator_name":"NDC summary","value":"\"By 2035, Pakistan aims to cut its projected emissions (2559 MtCO₂e) by 50% (around 1,280 MtCO₂e), with 33% of this reduction conditional upon adequate, grants-based, additional and new international climate financing, complemented by transfer of technology and capacity building and 17% to be achieved through domestic, unconditional efforts.\""},{"id":248926686,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248926878,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927031,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927163,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"mitigation_contribution_type","indicator_name":"Mitigation contribution type","value":"GHG target"},{"id":248927396,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"reduce its emissions after reaching peak levels to the extent possible"},{"id":248927565,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"Up to 20% reduction in GHG emissions by 2030 compared to the projected GHG emissions"},{"id":248927712,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"Pakistan commits to reducing its emissions by 50% by 2030 compared to BAU (15% unconditional, 35% conditional)."},{"id":248927844,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target","indicator_name":"GHG target","value":"Pakistan aims to reduce of its 2035 projected GHG emissions by 50 percent (17% unconditional and 33% conditional)"},{"id":248928093,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Trajectory target"},{"id":248928281,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928434,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928566,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Mitigation, Overview","overview_category":"GHG Target, Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"ghg_target_type","indicator_name":"GHG target type","value":"Baseline scenario target"},{"id":248928754,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"non_ghg_target","indicator_name":"Non-GHG target","value":"Not Specified"},{"id":248928934,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"non_ghg_target","indicator_name":"Non-GHG target","value":"\u003cp\u003e\"By 2030, 60 % of all energy produced in the country will be generated from renewable energy resources including hydropower.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"By 2030, 30 % of all new vehicles sold in Pakistan in various categories will be Electric Vehicles (EVs).\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"From 2020, new coal power plants are subject to a moratorium, and no generation of power through imported coal shall be allowed, shelving plans for two new coal fired power plants in favor of hydro-electric power and focusing on coal gasification and liquefaction for indigenous coal.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"2016 onwards, continued investments in NbS through the largest ever afforestation program in the history of the country—the Ten Billion Tree Tsunami Programme (TBTTP)—will sequester 148.76 MtCO2e emissions over the next 10 years.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"By 2023, total protected areas in the country will be enhanced from 12% to 15% that will result in preserving rare fauna / flora, green job opportunities for 5,500 people, and promoting eco-tourism.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"More than 12 GW under construction requiring about $20 billion (PPIB)\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"For rapid expansion of RE including hydropower, reaching 60%3 production by 2030 would require an estimated investment of US$50 Billion by 2030 and $80 Billion by 2040 (IGCEP 2021-30)\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"The policy sets the specific target of at least 20% RE generation by 2025 and at least 30% by 2030\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"Sectoral actions account for 6.4 MtCO2e emissions reduction by 2030\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"30% shift to electric passenger vehicles and 50% shift to electric two/three wheelers and buses by 2030.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"90% shift to electric passenger vehicles and 90% shift to electric two/three wheelers and buses by 2040.\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"Reduction of 0.9% of the total Industrial emissions for 2030 after the strong growth in this sector\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"Achieving Land Degradation Neutrality by 2030 Restoring 30% of degraded forest, 6% of degraded grassland and 10% of degraded wetlands, 5% of degraded cropland\"\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\""},{"id":248929151,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"Not Applicable"},{"id":248929342,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"2030"},{"id":248929494,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"2030"},{"id":248929626,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"time_target_year","indicator_name":"Target year (mitigation)","value":"2035"},{"id":248930308,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"timeframe","indicator_name":"Timeframe for implementation","value":"2016-2030"},{"id":248930458,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"timeframe","indicator_name":"Timeframe for implementation","value":"2021-2030"},{"id":248930590,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"timeframe","indicator_name":"Timeframe for implementation","value":"From 2025 to 2035"},{"id":248930843,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"adaptation","indicator_name":"Adaptation included","value":"Yes"},{"id":248931035,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"adaptation","indicator_name":"Adaptation included","value":"Yes"},{"id":248931187,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"adaptation","indicator_name":"Adaptation included","value":"Yes"},{"id":248931318,"source":"Climate Watch","iso_code3":"PAK","country":"Pakistan","global_category":"Overview","overview_category":"Summary of Commitment","sector":null,"subsector":null,"indicator_id":"adaptation","indicator_name":"Adaptation included","value":"Yes"}],"meta":{"sorting":{"sort_col":"iso_code3","sort_dir":"ASC"},"columns":["id","source","iso_code3","country","sector","subsector","indicator_slug","value","source","indicator_name"]}}